{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If an object is visible, approach and take it then process it. Move to drop off. If not visible, scan the area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = MoveForward    /> <SubTree ID = RobotTask    /> <Action ID = RotateRight    /> <Action ID = MoveToDropOff    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsPathClear    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />",
    "BT": {
